<title>SOUTH KOREA: LG in Armenia phone switch export deal.</title>
<headline>LG in Armenia phone switch export deal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's LG Information and Communication Ltd said on Monday it had agreed with the Armenian government to export some $25 million worth of telephone exchange systems and related equipment.</p>
<p>LG Information, a unit of the LG Group, said in a statement the deal was concluded when Armenia's Communications Minister Grigor Pokhpatyan recently visited South Korea.</p>
<p>LG said the two sides had also agreed in principle to cooperate in the Armenian government's future purchases of digital celullar phone systems.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
